# Example persona binding: copy to .minsky/binding.yaml (scripts/setup.sh does this if it is absent).
#
# Declares which personas are active for each /minsky invocation; `--personas a,b,c` overrides it per run.
# This list is the reference deployment's default set of six. Three more personas ship in
# .claude/skills/minsky/personas/ (agentic-context-engineering, research-infrastructure-stewardship,
# translation-fidelity). Several personas are domain worked examples; replace them with your own as needed.

default:
  active:
    - marcion-heresiologist
    - ml-finetuning-phd
    - performance-studies-roach
    - provenance-reproducibility
    - phd-documentation-currency
    - marcion-textual-critic
